<title>FRANCE: Metaleurop raises zinc price to 7,050 Ffr.</title>
<headline>Metaleurop raises zinc price to 7,050 Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metaleurop SA, a unit of Preussag, on Thursday raised its indicative zinc price to 7,050 francs per tonne, the company said.</p>
<p>The last change was to 6,700 francs on January 16.</p>
<p>Earlier Union Miniere SA subsidiary Union Miniere France raised its own indicative zinc price to 7,040 francs per tonne from 6,700 francs.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
